{"id":"n5-129","title":"まだ〜","romaji":"mada〜","jlptLevel":5,"shortExplanation":"Indicates something has not yet happened or is still happening; 'still', 'not yet'.","longExplanation":"The まだ〜 grammar point is used to express that something has not yet occurred or is still in progress. It can be translated as 'still' or 'not yet' in English. Depending on the context or if expressing the negative, まだ can be used with different combinations of verb, adjective, or noun.","formation":"まだ + Verb (non-past / negative / te-form), まだ + い-adjective, まだ + な-adjective + じゃない/ではない, まだ + Noun + じゃない/ではない","examples":[{"jp":"昼ご飯はまだ食べていません。","romaji":"Hirugohan wa mada tabete imasen.","en":"I haven't eaten lunch yet.","words":[{"surface":"昼","vocabId":"1426250","reading":"ひる"},{"surface":"ご飯","vocabId":"1270590","reading":"ごはん"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"まだ","vocabId":"1527110","reading":"まだ"},{"surface":"食べ","vocabId":"1358280","reading":"たべる","baseForm":"食べる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い","baseForm":"いる"},{"surface":"ませ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"ん","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3]},{"jp":"山田さんはまだ来ていません。","romaji":"Yamada-san wa mada kite imasen.","en":"Yamada-san has not arrived yet.","words":[{"surface":"山田","vocabId":null},{"surface":"さん","vocabId":"1579350","reading":"さん"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"まだ","vocabId":"1527110","reading":"まだ"},{"surface":"来","vocabId":"1547710","reading":"らい","baseForm":"来る"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い","baseForm":"いる"},{"surface":"ませ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"ん","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3]},{"jp":"この部屋はまだ暑いです。","romaji":"Kono heya wa mada atsui desu.","en":"This room is still hot.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"部屋","vocabId":"1499320","reading":"へや"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"まだ","vocabId":"1527110","reading":"まだ"},{"surface":"暑い","vocabId":"1343460","reading":"あつい"},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3]},{"jp":"彼はまだ学生じゃないです。","romaji":"Kare wa mada gakusei ja nai desu.","en":"He is not a student yet.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"まだ","vocabId":"1527110","reading":"まだ"},{"surface":"学生","vocabId":"1206900","reading":"がくせい"},{"surface":"じゃ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[2]}]}